Trademarks and third-party content
----------------------------------
ArchiMate and TOGAF are registered trademarks of The Open Group. Metamodel
packs that name ArchiMate or TOGAF elements reproduce element and relationship
names for interoperability only.

Higher-education reference models that a metamodel may cite are published
under their own licences and are not redistributed here; an institution loads
its own licensed copy.

The `packs/higher_education` pack is a university's TOGAF-based metamodel,
anonymised and expressed as configuration data for this engine. It is included
as the first worked configuration; the institution is not named.

Bundled third-party assets
--------------------------
`assets/icons/*.svg` are Tabler Icons (https://tabler.io/icons), copyright
2020-2026 Paweł Kuna, MIT License. They are bundled so the application makes
no request to a third-party icon service at run time.

`assets/vendor/mermaid.min.js` is Mermaid (https://mermaid.js.org), copyright
2014-2025 Knut Sveidqvist and contributors, MIT License, bundled so generated
diagrams render without a request to a content delivery network.

The draw.io export writes files in the diagrams.net (draw.io) XML format and
names ArchiMate 3 stencil shapes from that application (Apache License 2.0,
https://github.com/jgraph/drawio); no draw.io code is bundled.

archreator (https://github.com/roanboc/archreator), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 roanboc.
The validators under scripts/ (check_links.py, check_model.py, model_graph.py,
element-prefixes.json) are copies of the plugin's scaffold scripts; the method
itself is loaded as a plugin (.claude/settings.json).
